&lt;h6 class="smt_head5" style="padding-left:31.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;ｂ　保有目的が純投資目的である投資株式&lt;/h6&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:4.5pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:2pt;margin-bottom:2pt;"&gt;
